+  <li>dri/i915: Fix off-by-one in i830 clip region size.</li>
+</ul>
+
+<p>Alex Deucher (2):</p>
+<ul>
+  <li>r200: fix fog coordinate emit</li>
+  <li>radeon: fix fog coordinate emit</li>
+</ul>
+
+<p>Alexander von Gluck (4):</p>
