+</ul>
+
+<p>Brian Paul (17):</p>
+<ul>
+  <li>mesa: add a couple fast-paths to fast_read_rgba_pixels_memcpy()</li>
+  <li>mesa/gdi: remove wmesa_set_renderbuffer_funcs() function</li>
