+Gv = Gf * Gt<br>
+Bv = Bf * Bt<br>
+Av = Af<br>
+      </td>
+      <td style="vertical-align: top;">Rv = Rt<br>
+Gv = Gt<br>
+Bv = Bt<br>
+Av = Af</td>
